{"id":"nacio_n","lemma":"nación","pos":"noun","rank":1720,"glosses":["nation"],"ipa":"/naˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"naciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-naci%C3%B3n.wav","formAudio":{"naciones":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-Naciones.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Soy campeón de la nación.","en":"I'm the national champion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/427826","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"champion, champ"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"Somos una nación que ama la paz.","en":"We're a peace-loving nation.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"lady of the house"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"peace"}]},{"text":"A nuestra nación le gusta mucho el béisbol.","en":"Our nation is very fond of baseball.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687884","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"much"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"baseball"}]},{"text":"La nación estaba creciendo.","en":"The nation was growing.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to grow","l":"crecer"}]},{"text":"La nación entera estaba alegre por la noticia.","en":"The entire nation was glad at the news.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"whole","l":"entero"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to make happy","l":"alegrar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"notice"}]}]}